    S:gt.blockmachines.electricimplosioncompressor.name=电动聚爆压缩机
    S:gt.blockmachines.electricimplosioncompressor.tooltip=机器类型：§e聚爆压缩机§7；机器简称：§eEIC§r\n爆炸就是艺术！\n用电代替爆炸物\n§6并行数§7取决于§f防护方块§7等级\n§f中子§7：§61§7并行\n§c无尽§7：§64§7并行\n§8超时空金属§7：§616§7并行\n§d时空§7：§664§7并行\n§3宇宙素§7：§6256§7并行\n这台机器最多可运行比其能源仓平均等级高1级的配方\n§a支持TecTech多A能源仓与激光仓!\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\n按住 §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 以显示结构指导
    S:gt.blockmachines.electricimplosioncompressor.tooltip.15563=Machine Type: §eImplosion Compressor, EIC§r\nExplosions are fun!\nUses electricity instead of Explosives\n§6Parallels§7 are determined by §fContainment Block§7 Tier\n§fNeutronium§7 : §61§7 Parallel\n§cInfinity§7 : §64§7 Parallels\n§8Transcendent Metal§7 : §616§7 Parallels\n§dSpacetime§7 : §664§7 Parallels\n§3Universium§7 : §6256§7 Parallels\nEnergy Hatch Tier is limited by Glass Tier\n§c§l§nUMV§r§7-glass unlocks all above energy tiers\nThis machine can run recipes at most 1 tiers above its average energy hatch tier\n§aSupports TecTech Multi-Amp and Laser Hatches!\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nHold §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 to display structure guidelines\nStructure by: §a§6Pix3lated§r§7
    S:gt.blockmachines.electricimplosioncompressor.tooltip_secondary=§f大小§7(§6宽§7x§6高§7x§6长§7)：§63§7x§69§7x§63§7\n§f结构：\n   §f控制器：      §7正面第三层中央\n   剩余方块为§7脱氧钢机械方块§r(至少§68§r个！)\n   爆炸危险警示方块可替换机械方块\n§f   变压器绕组方块：§72,3,7,8层外围\n§f   镍锌铁氧体块：§72,3,7,8层中央\n§f   防护方块：§7    4,5,6层\n§f   维护仓：§7      任意脱氧钢机械方块\n§f   输入总线：§7    任意脱氧钢机械方块\n§f   输入仓：§7      任意脱氧钢机械方块\n§f   输出仓：§7      任意脱氧钢机械方块\n§f   能源仓：§7      顶层和/或底层中央\n   使用子信道§6piston_block§r§7设定§6金属方块的等级\n   §7§m------------------------------\n§f结构太复杂了！\n§f请在主方块上使用§9Structure§1Lib§r§f全息投影仪，以查看整体结构！
    S:gt.blockmachines.electricimplosioncompressor.tooltip_secondary.15563=§fDimensions: §615§7x§67§7x§67§7 (§6W§7x§6H§7x§6L§7) \n§fStructure: \n   §fController: §7Front bottom center\n§6   230x §r§7Naquadah Reinforced Block (minimum)\n§6   2x §r§7Naquadah Frame Box\n§6   20x §r§7PTFE Pipe Casing\n§6   22x §r§7Any Tiered Glass (tiered)\n§6   36x §r§7Robust Tungstensteel Machine Casing\n§6   24x §r§7Containment Blocks (tiered)\n§f   Maintenance Hatch: §7Any Naquadah Reinforced Block\n§f   Input Bus: §7Any Naquadah Reinforced Block\n§f   Input Hatch: §7Any Naquadah Reinforced Block\n§f   Output Bus: §7Any Naquadah Reinforced Block\n§f   Energy Hatch: §7Any Naquadah Reinforced Block\n   Uses sub channel §6piston_block§r§7 for §6Metal Block Tier\n   §7§m------------------------------\n§fTo see the structure, use a§9 Structure§1Lib §r§fHologram Projector on the Controller!
