    S:gt.blockmachines.frf.tooltip=机器类型：§e硅岩燃料精炼厂§r\n生产硅岩燃料\n需要力场约束线圈方块以控制致命辐射\n使用高阶线圈以解锁更多可用燃料以及更多无损超频次数\n§a支持TecTech多A能源仓与激光仓!\n只要有足够的能量，这台机器能运行任何等级的配方\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\n按住 §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 以显示结构指导
    S:gt.blockmachines.frf.tooltip.16999=Machine Type: §eNaquadah Fuel Refinery, NFR§r\n§4DEPRECATED - Controller will be removed in next major update!\n§4Check NEI for new Controller and conversion recipe\nProduces naquadah fuels\nNeeds field restriction coils to control the fatal radiation\nUse higher tier coils to unlock more fuel types and perform more perfect overclocks\n§aSupports TecTech Multi-Amp and Laser Hatches!\nThis machine can run recipes regardless of tier, if given enough energy\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nHold §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 to display structure guidelines
