    S:gt.blockmachines.frf.tooltip_secondary.16999=§fDimensions: §63§7x§615§7x§615§7 (§6W§7x§6H§7x§6L§7) \n§fStructure: \n   §fController: §7Middle of the third layer\n§6   114x §r§7Naquadah Fuel Refinery Casing\n§6   32x §r§7Field Restriction Coil (tiered)\n§6   8x §r§7Field Restriction Glass\n§f   Input Hatch: §7The casings adjacent to field restriction glass.\n§f   Input Bus: §7The casings adjacent to field restriction glass.\n§f   Output Hatch: §7The casings adjacent to field restriction glass.\n§f   Energy Hatch: §7The casings adjacent to field restriction glass.\n§f   Dynamo Hatch: §7The casings adjacent to field restriction glass.\n   §7§m------------------------------\n§fTo see the structure, use a§9 Structure§1Lib §r§fHologram Projector on the Controller!
