    S:gt.blockmachines.multimachine.boiler.bronze.name=大型青铜锅炉
    S:gt.blockmachines.multimachine.boiler.bronze.tooltip=机器类型：§e锅炉§r\n每块煤炭将以16000升/秒的速率产生共计32000升的蒸汽\n在控制器方块中放入编程电路以进行节流(每点配置减少1000升/秒的流量)\n无法使用燃烧值太高或太低的固体燃料\n柴油类燃料只有1/4的效率,且需要31.25秒进行预热\n每秒产生§5200§7点污染\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\n按住 §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 以显示结构指导
    S:gt.blockmachines.multimachine.boiler.bronze.tooltip.15529=Machine Type: §eBoiler§r\nProduces 32,000L of Steam with 1 Coal at 16,000L/s\nA programmed circuit in the main block throttles the boiler (-1000L/s per config)\nSolid Fuels with a burn value that is too high or too low will not work\nDiesel fuels have 1/4 efficiency - Takes 31.25 seconds to heat up\n§5200 §7Pollution per second\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nHold §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 to display structure guidelines\nStructure by: §a§6PCGMatt§r§7
