    S:gt.blockmachines.multimachine.boiler.tungstensteel.name=大型钨钢锅炉
    S:gt.blockmachines.multimachine.boiler.tungstensteel.tooltip=机器类型：§e锅炉§r\n每块煤炭将以213,333升/秒的速率产生共计32000升的过热蒸汽\n在控制器方块中放入编程电路以进行节流(每点配置减少1000升/秒的流量)\n仅支持部分固体燃料(请查看NEI中大型锅炉标签页)\n当输入总线中存在不支持燃料时,锅炉无法运行!\n柴油类燃料只有1/4的效率,且需要125秒进行预热\n每秒产生§51600§7点污染\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\n按住 §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 以显示结构指导
    S:gt.blockmachines.multimachine.boiler.tungstensteel.tooltip.15532=Machine Type: §eBoiler§r\nProduces 32,000L of Superheated Steam with 1 Coal at 213,333L/s\nA programmed circuit in the main block throttles the boiler (-1000L/s per config)\nOnly some solid fuels are allowed (check the NEI Large Boiler tab for details)\nIf there are any disallowed fuels in the input bus, the boiler won't run!\nDiesel fuels have 1/4 efficiency - Takes 125 seconds to heat up\n§51600 §7Pollution per second\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nHold §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 to display structure guidelines\nStructure by: §a§6PCGMatt§r§7
