    S:gt.blockmachines.multimachine.boiler.tungstensteel.tooltip_secondary.15532=§fDimensions: §65§7x§66§7x§63§7 (§6W§7x§6H§7x§6L§7) \n§fStructure: \n   §fController: §7Front bottom\n§6   24x §r§7TungstenSteel Machine Casings Casing (minimum)\n§f   TungstenSteel Fire Boxes: §7Bottom layer, 3 minimum\n§f   TungstenSteel Pipe Casing Blocks: §7Inner 3 blocks\n§f   Maintenance Hatch: §7Any firebox\n§f   Muffler Hatch: §7Any firebox\n§f   Input Bus: §7Solid fuel, Any firebox\n§f   Input Hatch: §7Liquid fuel, Any firebox\n   You can use either, or both\n§f   Input Hatch: §7Water, Any firebox\n§f   Output Hatch: §7Steam, any casing\n   §7§m------------------------------\n§fTo see the structure, use a§9 Structure§1Lib §r§fHologram Projector on the Controller!
